WEBVTT

00:00:11.137 --> 00:00:13.848
An emergency message from the admiral.

00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:17.852
That was sooner than anticipated.

00:00:18.102 --> 00:00:20.688
I guess such is to be expected
from the Amethyst of Chaos.

00:00:20.938 --> 00:00:21.814
What shall we do?

00:00:22.064 --> 00:00:26.527
I could return to the capital
alone and extract the Augusta...

00:00:28.112 --> 00:00:30.740
Let's leave this in Sadri's hands for a while.

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:33.034
If things go as planned...

00:00:34.327 --> 00:00:37.997
Once we finish this, the fighting will be over.

00:00:39.207 --> 00:00:45.796
<i>No matter what might await us there</i>

00:00:46.047 --> 00:00:54.472
<i>I'll go to unexplored territory with you</i>

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:10.780
<i>I just had a short dream</i>

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:15.409
<i>In it, I saw your back</i>

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:21.582
<i>Was it the past? The future?</i>

00:01:21.832 --> 00:01:32.343
<i>Ignore the needle on that meter
pointing to the red zone</i>

00:01:32.593 --> 00:01:35.471
<i>And go where the tailwinds
and your feelings point you</i>

00:01:35.721 --> 00:01:41.644
<i>Every time I flap my wings, it makes me realize</i>

00:01:41.894 --> 00:01:47.191
<i>That there are skies
I'll never be able to see again</i>

00:01:47.441 --> 00:01:52.697
<i>But if you still want to take flight</i>

00:01:52.947 --> 00:01:59.495
<i>Then I will be your wings</i>

00:02:17.847 --> 00:02:20.224
It appears Kumari, Batos,

00:02:20.474 --> 00:02:23.019
Rhaetus, and other repatriate
provinces have already united in revolt

00:02:23.269 --> 00:02:29.358
alongside the remaining Glacies forces
and several Sky Pirate camps.

00:02:29.608 --> 00:02:31.193
There are also rumors

00:02:31.444 --> 00:02:34.864
that the survivors of Turan have
rallied around Second Princess Millia.

00:02:36.449 --> 00:02:40.286
Vasant is certainly a bold one...

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:44.040
What is the status of the Exiles?

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:50.087
The Glacies Exile has been
rendered completely inoperable.

00:02:50.338 --> 00:02:54.425
Meaning there's no chance
the rebel forces can use it...

00:02:54.675 --> 00:02:58.179
In one sense, this rebellion has
actually greatly benefited us.

00:02:58.429 --> 00:03:03.100
All potential opposition has been
exposed to us in one fell swoop.

00:03:03.351 --> 00:03:06.354
Once we've taken them out, the world will be...

00:03:06.604 --> 00:03:09.815
So that is the premier's true goal...

00:03:11.442 --> 00:03:13.527
We've been beaten to the draw.

00:03:13.778 --> 00:03:17.865
Pointing out Luscinia's atrocities
to unite lands far and wide

00:03:18.115 --> 00:03:21.243
and create a grand
anti-Ades Federation alliance...

00:03:21.494 --> 00:03:25.664
That's what we had originally
hoped to accomplish with Turan.

00:03:25.915 --> 00:03:31.754
The declaration of our newfound
alliance probably spurred them on.

00:03:32.004 --> 00:03:34.340
The momentum is in place.

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:36.967
Now it's just a matter of making good on it.

00:03:37.218 --> 00:03:44.517
But we can't make a move now
that Ades is right at our doorstep.

00:03:45.559 --> 00:03:50.231
It's our mission to protect this
land of wheat to the very end.

00:03:50.481 --> 00:03:53.984
Looks like we'll have to hold
out until Lady Sophia returns.

00:03:54.235 --> 00:03:55.694
Yes...

00:03:57.029 --> 00:03:59.698
Oh! Princess Millia is here!

00:04:00.741 --> 00:04:03.202
Long live Princess Millia!

00:04:05.496 --> 00:04:07.915
Long live Turan!

00:04:11.127 --> 00:04:13.379
The Turans seem so thrilled!

00:04:13.629 --> 00:04:16.674
They're all pinning their hopes on this rebellion.

00:04:16.924 --> 00:04:18.884
That doesn't seem right to me.

00:04:19.135 --> 00:04:22.471
They completely ignored Millia
when she was fighting all alone...

00:04:22.721 --> 00:04:25.766
Soldiers are nothing but birdbrains, that's all.

00:04:26.892 --> 00:04:29.228
Federation General Vasant...

00:04:29.478 --> 00:04:31.856
Can we really trust her?

00:04:32.106 --> 00:04:35.484
We're powerless as we are now.

00:04:35.734 --> 00:04:40.322
If something's brewing within Ades,
then we should use it to our advantage.

00:04:40.573 --> 00:04:43.033
Like they say, your enemy's
enemy is your friend.

00:04:43.284 --> 00:04:48.247
If things get hairy, let's take the
princess and haul butt outta here!

00:04:48.497 --> 00:04:49.498
Right!

00:04:49.748 --> 00:04:52.209
Lady Vasant has arrived!

00:04:55.921 --> 00:04:58.841
We have been expecting you.

00:04:59.091 --> 00:05:06.056
We, the Anti-Luscinia Joint Forces,
welcome you all.

00:05:06.307 --> 00:05:11.937
But Luscinia has been fighting all
this time for the sake of the people!

00:05:12.188 --> 00:05:12.938
So why do you...?!

00:05:13.189 --> 00:05:15.691
His way of fighting is the problem.

00:05:17.359 --> 00:05:22.615
He has killed far more people
than necessary, expanded the war,

00:05:22.865 --> 00:05:26.118
and plunged the entire world
into suffering and chaos.

00:05:26.368 --> 00:05:30.289
His sins are beyond unforgivable.

00:05:31.665 --> 00:05:37.922
Luscinia's methods will <i>never</i> make the
late Augusta Farahn5z's wish a reality!

00:05:39.673 --> 00:05:42.426
Augusta! Please give your decision!

00:05:49.433 --> 00:05:51.227
Augusta Sire-l.

00:05:51.477 --> 00:05:54.897
Princess Millia of Turan has arrived.

00:06:01.904 --> 00:06:04.698
So this is the Ades palace...

00:06:04.949 --> 00:06:06.283
It seems bland compared to Turan's.

00:06:06.534 --> 00:06:08.953
“Pam!
“Pam!

00:06:09.203 --> 00:06:12.873
All visitors from foreign lands say that.

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:19.547
I offer my sincerest apologies for her rudeness!

00:06:19.797 --> 00:06:20.965
Not at all.

00:06:21.215 --> 00:06:25.261
Morvarid is a place of memories
for those who survived

00:06:25.511 --> 00:06:28.514
the great cataclysm so long ago.

00:06:29.723 --> 00:06:34.687
As the only habitable area after the
lakes froze and the earth grew sterile,

00:06:34.937 --> 00:06:39.775
it was the last bastion for
those abandoned by the Exiles.

00:06:40.025 --> 00:06:41.986
To this day, our capital rests on this land

00:06:42.236 --> 00:06:45.698
so that we may never
forget that time in history.

00:06:48.367 --> 00:06:49.827
Please, come this way.

00:06:50.077 --> 00:06:51.829
The Augusta awaits.

00:06:58.544 --> 00:07:01.130
--She really is just a kid!
--Fam!

00:07:02.339 --> 00:07:04.592
L-I can't help it; I heard she was a kid,

00:07:04.842 --> 00:07:06.844
but I didn't think she was such a little--

00:07:07.094 --> 00:07:09.930
Although a child, I am the Augusta!

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:16.395
E-Even I understand that I'm still
a child and powerless to do much...

00:07:16.645 --> 00:07:20.899
But... But I am the Augusta!

00:07:22.109 --> 00:07:25.404
For the sake of the people, I... I...

00:07:25.654 --> 00:07:26.697
<i>I'm sorry'.!</i>

00:07:26.947 --> 00:07:29.617
I'm truly sorry!

00:07:29.867 --> 00:07:32.786
I beg your forgiveness, Augusta Sire-l!

00:07:33.037 --> 00:07:37.333
I promise she will receive
a thorough scolding later.

00:07:39.627 --> 00:07:40.753
Augusta.

00:07:41.003 --> 00:07:45.674
These kind girls are victims
of Luscinia's war as well.

00:07:47.593 --> 00:07:50.429
You must be exhausted
from your long journey here.

00:07:50.679 --> 00:07:55.351
I hope you will find it to
your liking. Please enjoy!

00:07:55.601 --> 00:07:57.603
Thank you.

00:07:57.853 --> 00:07:59.980
--Thanks for the food!
--Thank you for the food.

00:08:02.858 --> 00:08:05.402
Princess Millia, after hearing
of your participation,

00:08:05.653 --> 00:08:09.907
Turan soldiers in hiding throughout
the land have been gathering en masse.

00:08:10.157 --> 00:08:13.994
I return them all to you.

00:08:14.244 --> 00:08:19.833
The people of Turan will surely be
at their finest under your guidance.

00:08:20.084 --> 00:08:21.669
You're willing to do that?

00:08:21.919 --> 00:08:25.422
We have high hopes for you as well, Princess.

00:08:25.673 --> 00:08:29.885
You've successfully fought
Luscinia and survived, after all.

00:08:30.135 --> 00:08:34.098
I... didn't do it alone, though.

00:08:38.936 --> 00:08:41.730
Silvius the Reaper...

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:46.193
I've heard all about it.
Do you know where they are now?

00:08:46.443 --> 00:08:50.864
I'm afraid I don't.
We've lost all contact with them...

00:08:51.115 --> 00:08:52.908
I see...

00:08:53.158 --> 00:08:55.619
If only the people of Anatoray were here...

00:08:55.869 --> 00:09:01.792
No. Your presence alone gives us more
than enough reassurance, Princess.

00:09:03.377 --> 00:09:07.339
Luscinia still has many resources at his disposal.

00:09:07.589 --> 00:09:12.261
But we can no longer
overlook his atrocious actions.

00:09:12.511 --> 00:09:16.181
The ideal that we lost ten years ago...

00:09:16.432 --> 00:09:18.183
The late Augusta Farahn5z's wish...

00:09:18.434 --> 00:09:21.019
Now is the time for us to reclaim it.

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:25.065
And to do so, we will eliminate Luscinia!

00:09:29.194 --> 00:09:32.072
Please, eat up, everyone!

00:09:32.322 --> 00:09:36.618
These are the first oranges of the season,
picked from a Notos oasis.

00:09:36.869 --> 00:09:39.830
Uhh... Is this the first of the season too?

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.874
Fan'!

00:09:42.124 --> 00:09:44.168
Is it not to your liking?

00:09:44.418 --> 00:09:48.964
That's millet porridge. It's a staple dish here.

00:09:49.214 --> 00:09:52.301
We eat it daily; everyone from
the Augusta to the citizens.

00:09:52.551 --> 00:09:53.343
This?!

00:09:53.594 --> 00:09:58.974
Land capable of growing good wheat
is difficult to come by here.

00:09:59.224 --> 00:10:00.893
I'm sorry.

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:03.937
For calling you a kid.

00:10:04.188 --> 00:10:08.150
You really are this country's Augusta after all!

00:10:10.402 --> 00:10:14.031
General Vasant seems pretty nice, huh?

00:10:14.281 --> 00:10:15.741
Yeah.

00:10:15.991 --> 00:10:18.452
She's having a tough time, too.

00:10:18.702 --> 00:10:20.746
The Augusta is already in her good hands,

00:10:20.996 --> 00:10:25.000
but these joint forces are still
nothing but a ragtag team.

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:27.836
I never realized Ades had decent people too!

00:10:28.086 --> 00:10:31.256
That Sire“! seems like she'll make a great ruler.

00:10:31.507 --> 00:10:33.842
Now if we can just get rid of Luscinia...

00:10:36.553 --> 00:10:37.846
Dyan!

00:10:38.096 --> 00:10:40.224
You're all right! That's great!

00:10:40.474 --> 00:10:42.935
So you guys are joining in too?!

00:10:45.187 --> 00:10:46.855
<i>Dy an'?</i>

00:10:46.939 --> 00:10:51.693
I value that you are part of this joint force now.

00:10:51.944 --> 00:10:55.280
But we can't be friends with kin...

00:10:55.531 --> 00:10:58.992
...of the one who destroyed our motherland.

00:10:59.243 --> 00:11:04.623
Our goddess has been slain.
We have nothing to protect anymore.

00:11:05.749 --> 00:11:10.212
Vengeance... <i>will</i> be ours.

00:11:12.798 --> 00:11:17.219
She says she can't be friends with
the sister of her sworn enemy...

00:11:21.723 --> 00:11:23.308
Dyan...

00:11:29.439 --> 00:11:32.484
To think that Vasant would incite a revolt...

00:11:32.734 --> 00:11:35.737
Well, Chaos was essentially
treated as a sacrificial pawn

00:11:35.988 --> 00:11:39.324
during this latest battle.

00:11:39.575 --> 00:11:41.243
What do you think?

00:11:41.493 --> 00:11:43.537
About the premier?

00:11:45.831 --> 00:11:50.460
Saying it aloud will get us
all put to death, you know.

00:11:52.254 --> 00:11:56.216
--SorlTlsh--
--Just drop it... (_)rang.

00:12:00.095 --> 00:12:02.598
Enter.

00:12:02.848 --> 00:12:04.308
You have orders to move out.

00:12:04.558 --> 00:12:08.604
You're to make for the fortress city
of Boreas before dawn tomorrow...

00:12:08.854 --> 00:12:10.772
...and conquer it.

00:12:12.774 --> 00:12:15.110
The fortress city of Boreas.

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:19.072
It's a key strategic point positioned
between Ades and Glacies,

00:12:19.323 --> 00:12:22.701
where Luscinia's forces are presently stationed.

00:12:23.952 --> 00:12:27.122
Boreas possesses a large-scale battleship dock,

00:12:27.372 --> 00:12:32.502
an abundant stockpile of ammunition,
and Claudia deposits.

00:12:32.753 --> 00:12:34.922
It's also a major traffic artery

00:12:35.172 --> 00:12:39.968
through which all northeastern
Grand Lake routes pass.

00:12:41.261 --> 00:12:45.641
It is no exaggeration to say
that whoever controls this land

00:12:45.891 --> 00:12:49.269
also controls the northern
shores of the Grand Lake.

00:12:49.519 --> 00:12:53.398
Is the fortress's leadership
under Luscinia's control?

00:12:53.649 --> 00:12:54.399
No.

00:12:54.650 --> 00:12:58.862
We've already called for it to be placed
under the Augusta's direct command.

00:13:00.072 --> 00:13:03.992
We must first assemble our teams here in Boreas

00:13:04.242 --> 00:13:06.912
and fend off Luscinia's forces.

00:13:07.162 --> 00:13:11.333
Their long excursion into Glacies
has stretched their supply line.

00:13:11.583 --> 00:13:15.921
As they weaken, we will seek further
support from around the world.

00:13:16.171 --> 00:13:19.216
And then we will besiege Luscinia's forces!

00:13:19.466 --> 00:13:22.636
If we can deal a blow to Luscinia at Boreas,

00:13:22.886 --> 00:13:25.430
more will stand up to support us.

00:13:25.681 --> 00:13:28.767
Forget just a "blow"! Let's annihilate them!

00:13:29.017 --> 00:13:32.270
Let's treat those tyrants to a bloodbath!

00:13:33.939 --> 00:13:39.486
For our brethren who were killed
in Glacies, their blood will spill!

00:13:39.736 --> 00:13:41.905
Justice will be ours!

00:13:42.155 --> 00:13:43.865
Victory to the Joint Forces!

00:13:44.116 --> 00:13:46.284
Death to the vile tyrants!

00:13:46.535 --> 00:13:50.664
And a merciless death to the
Turan witch who served them!

00:13:50.914 --> 00:13:52.207
Death to the tyrants!

00:13:52.457 --> 00:13:54.626
Death to the Turan witch!

00:13:57.004 --> 00:13:58.463
Hold on!

00:14:03.510 --> 00:14:06.388
U-Uhh, let's all just calm down here...

00:14:06.638 --> 00:14:09.141
There's no need to be so bloodthirsty...

00:14:09.391 --> 00:14:11.560
Be quiet, amateur!

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:13.145
Amateur?

00:14:13.395 --> 00:14:16.231
It's true I'm not a soldier like you guys, but--!

00:14:16.481 --> 00:14:19.985
Good, then keep your mouth shut!

00:14:20.235 --> 00:14:23.280
But isn't peace why you're all here?!

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:25.282
We're going to grant Augusta Farahn5z's wish

00:14:25.532 --> 00:14:27.868
and hold a Grand Race, right?!

00:14:28.118 --> 00:14:31.788
Even I know we can't do that without fighting!

00:14:32.039 --> 00:14:35.208
But wanting to kill and get revenge
on everyone right off the bat...

00:14:35.459 --> 00:14:40.380
Will that really...
Will that really bring world peace?!

00:14:41.423 --> 00:14:45.886
You didn't have your friends slaughtered!
You wouldn't understand!

00:14:46.762 --> 00:14:48.221
Fam...

00:14:50.515 --> 00:14:52.851
It's okay. That's enough.

00:14:53.101 --> 00:14:54.561
Millia...

00:14:56.980 --> 00:15:00.776
I'll contact you all when I've drawn up
the Boreas defensive formation,

00:15:01.026 --> 00:15:03.278
which will be ready by tomorrow.

00:15:03.528 --> 00:15:06.281
I thank you for your cooperation.

00:15:11.578 --> 00:15:14.081
Urgh! I can't believe those guys!

00:15:14.331 --> 00:15:15.499
Calm down, Fam.

00:15:15.749 --> 00:15:18.085
Yeah, so maybe I'm an amateur!

00:15:18.335 --> 00:15:20.879
And maybe I don't know how they feel!

00:15:21.129 --> 00:15:24.174
But that feeling in the air was all wrong!

00:15:24.424 --> 00:15:27.677
Thank you, Fam. Don't worry about me.

00:15:30.639 --> 00:15:35.936
Whatever the case, we must
defend Boreas Fortress at all costs.

00:15:36.186 --> 00:15:38.146
Are you going to send the Turan fleet out too?

00:15:38.396 --> 00:15:39.606
Good question.

00:15:39.856 --> 00:15:44.653
We have so little time
to really organize it now...

00:15:44.903 --> 00:15:49.449
But we must fight... for Turan's future.

00:15:49.699 --> 00:15:52.661
--Don't worry, Millia!
--Fam...

00:15:52.911 --> 00:15:56.414
If something happens, you can
always act as a go-between

00:15:56.665 --> 00:16:00.085
between these joint forces
and Princess Lily's side, right?

00:16:01.128 --> 00:16:05.006
And if that happens, I'll be your wings.

00:16:09.136 --> 00:16:10.971
Umm...

00:16:19.312 --> 00:16:23.441
You mean your father won the Grand Race?!

00:16:23.692 --> 00:16:24.609
Y-Yes.

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:27.070
Wow! That's amazing!

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:31.449
Yeah, Atamora's team was
totally awesome that day!

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:36.288
We practiced really hard to
be like 'em someday, y'know!

00:16:36.538 --> 00:16:38.415
I mean, "you know." Yeah.

00:16:38.665 --> 00:16:40.041
Oh, don't worry about being formal.

00:16:40.292 --> 00:16:43.670
So tell me more about the Grand Race!

00:16:44.713 --> 00:16:48.049
They say the Grand Race
was my mother's dream.

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:51.595
A fanciful celebration that would
bring everyone happiness...

00:16:51.845 --> 00:16:53.054
That's right!

00:16:53.305 --> 00:16:57.142
That's why I'm absolutely going
to make another one happen!

00:16:57.392 --> 00:17:00.937
I got it! You can help us hold a Grand Race too!

00:17:01.188 --> 00:17:02.439
M-Me...?

00:17:02.689 --> 00:17:03.857
Yeah!

00:17:04.107 --> 00:17:06.568
Oh, why didn't I think of it before?!

00:17:06.818 --> 00:17:09.279
If we all work together, it'll be perfect! Right?!

00:17:09.529 --> 00:17:11.907
Oh, Fam...

00:17:12.157 --> 00:17:14.701
You and me...

00:17:14.951 --> 00:17:16.828
...holding a Grand Race?

00:17:17.871 --> 00:17:21.374
Everyone smiled <i>so</i> much that day!

00:17:21.625 --> 00:17:25.670
They all looked up at
Atamora's Vespa with a smile...!

00:17:27.047 --> 00:17:28.798
Oh, do you know what Vespas are?

00:17:29.049 --> 00:17:31.760
They're small Sky Pirate Vanships.

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:35.013
They're tiny, but have lots of power!

00:17:35.263 --> 00:17:38.808
They're kinda like our ultimate weapon, y'know?

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:48.610
Thirty-one battleships and six supply vessels.

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:51.738
That's a lot more than I expected!

00:17:51.988 --> 00:17:55.617
There are many others out there still in hiding.

00:17:55.867 --> 00:17:58.370
I'm sure that when they hear you
have joined our cause, Princess,

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:00.830
they will all rush to our support.

00:18:01.081 --> 00:18:03.875
That's encouraging to hear.

00:18:07.963 --> 00:18:11.424
At long last, we can finally
return to our homeland...!

00:18:11.675 --> 00:18:13.468
How long it's been...

00:18:13.718 --> 00:18:16.137
If only Grandfather were still alive...

00:18:16.388 --> 00:18:19.224
Hey! Will we get to eat meat in Turan?

00:18:19.474 --> 00:18:20.767
Meat! Meat!

00:18:21.017 --> 00:18:22.102
You bet!

00:18:22.352 --> 00:18:23.520
Not just meat, though;

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:28.275
from now on you'll be able to eat all
the fish and pastry treats you want!

00:18:28.525 --> 00:18:30.360
Ya)!

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:32.070
Are those people...?!

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:34.572
Please don't mind them, Princess Millia.

00:18:34.823 --> 00:18:37.117
Come this way.

00:18:37.367 --> 00:18:41.204
They're the people who
lived in Turan before us...

00:18:41.454 --> 00:18:43.331
Please don't mind them.

00:18:43.581 --> 00:18:49.754
As part of the joint forces, there's nothing
we can do to stop them at present.

00:18:51.881 --> 00:18:55.218
At last, I can plant this seed...

00:19:01.349 --> 00:19:07.022
<i>Did you see this too, Sister?</i>

00:19:07.272 --> 00:19:11.693
And then they pulled off a perfect Split-S!

00:19:11.943 --> 00:19:14.654
It was like, "Whoosh!" and then...!

00:19:14.904 --> 00:19:17.824
Wow! Wow!

00:19:19.993 --> 00:19:22.454
What is it you want to show us?

00:19:22.704 --> 00:19:24.497
This way, this way!

00:19:24.748 --> 00:19:27.292
This is my mother.

00:19:28.543 --> 00:19:30.420
I don't remember her.

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:35.508
I was still little when she passed away.

00:19:35.759 --> 00:19:38.345
So this painting is all I have...

00:19:42.223 --> 00:19:44.476
That's too bad.

00:19:44.726 --> 00:19:46.895
I want to be like my mother.

00:19:47.145 --> 00:19:49.356
You will, Sari. I know it.

00:19:49.606 --> 00:19:51.274
But...!

00:19:52.942 --> 00:19:56.488
Vasant and Luscinia had a fight.

00:19:56.738 --> 00:20:01.076
They both worked so
very hard for this land, yet...

00:20:01.326 --> 00:20:03.203
Yet...

00:20:03.453 --> 00:20:05.538
It's because I'm a child...

00:20:05.789 --> 00:20:08.541
It's because I'm not reliable...

00:20:08.792 --> 00:20:11.044
That's why...

00:20:11.294 --> 00:20:14.047
That's why everyone...

00:20:34.984 --> 00:20:39.114
Luscinia was my mother's bodyguard.

00:20:39.364 --> 00:20:44.494
When she died, he blamed himself.

00:20:44.744 --> 00:20:48.748
So he vowed to protect me no matter what.

00:20:48.998 --> 00:20:53.211
And that's how he became
the premier of this land.

00:20:53.461 --> 00:20:56.339
All he wanted was to create a peaceful world

00:20:56.589 --> 00:20:59.759
where I could always smile...

00:21:04.472 --> 00:21:07.725
Luscinia said he has a dream.

00:21:07.976 --> 00:21:10.937
A very dear and important dream...

00:21:13.022 --> 00:21:19.237
He said there's a big, ancient goddess
sleeping at the world's end.

00:21:19.487 --> 00:21:25.869
And he says he wants to
save this world with her.

00:22:30.892 --> 00:22:36.481
<i>How high are the skies,</i>

00:22:36.731 --> 00:22:42.529
<i>how strong are the winds,</i>

00:22:42.779 --> 00:22:48.368
<i>how clear are the waters</i>

00:22:48.618 --> 00:22:55.667
<i>you hold in your heart?</i>

00:22:56.876 --> 00:23:08.346
<i>One day I want to be the palm
of your hand and catch your tears</i>

00:23:08.596 --> 00:23:20.441
<i>I want us to share the
same sorrows, the same air</i>

00:23:20.692 --> 00:23:26.281
<i>I'll point the prow of this departing ship</i>

00:23:26.531 --> 00:23:35.081
<i>Right your way with no hesitation</i>

00:23:35.331 --> 00:23:41.045
<i>Let's raise the mast in this sea of wind</i>

00:23:41.296 --> 00:23:46.843
<i>And set sail on these waves of clouds</i>

00:23:47.093 --> 00:23:52.599
<i>With the faraway stars for a compass</i>

00:23:52.849 --> 00:24:00.523
<i>I'll head beyond the horizon with you</i>

00:24:03.526 --> 00:24:05.278
<i>Augusta Sari is actually really nice!</i>

00:24:05.528 --> 00:24:08.573
<i>Yeah! And we agreed to have
more fun tomorrow too!</i>

00:24:08.823 --> 00:24:11.784
<i>But this is an Augusta we're
dealing with. Don't do anything rude.</i>

00:24:12.035 --> 00:24:13.077
<i>Yeah, I know.</i>

00:24:13.328 --> 00:24:16.289
<i>If you teach her any sordid games or foul words,</i>

00:24:16.539 --> 00:24:19.042
<i>General Vasant may decide to execute you.</i>

00:24:19.292 --> 00:24:22.754
<i>Y-You know I'd never do anything like that!</i>

00:24:23.004 --> 00:24:26.466
<i>What in the world are you doing, Augusta?!</i>

00:24:26.716 --> 00:24:27.842
<i>Uh oh!</i>

00:24:28.092 --> 00:24:29.886
<i>Pam!</i>
